inalized from those identical cached statistics\n  using exactly the formulas implemented in `output/analysis.py`. Re-running\n  `python output/analysis.py` with the inputs present reproduces the full\n  pipeline end-to-end (GTF parsing -> marker resolution -> streaming promoter\n  scan -> scoring -> ranking -> decision, ~1-2 min).\n'\"'@\nSet-Content -Path output/report.md -Value \"'$content -Encoding utf8\nWrite-Output ('\"'report.md written, ' + (Get-Item output/report.md).Length + ' bytes')\nGet-ChildItem output | ForEach-Object { \"'$_.Name + '\"' [' + \"'$_.Length + '\"']' }\n'@ | Set-Content -Encoding utf8 scratch/write_report.py; python -c \\\"print('skip')\\\" ; powershell -NoProfile -Command \\\"Set-Content -Path scratch/write_report.ps1 -Value (Get-Content scratch/write_report.py -Raw) -Encoding utf8\\\" 2>\"'$null; .'\"\\\\scratch\\\\write_report.py\"","aggregated_output":"","exit_code":1,"status":"failed"}}
